				<h2 class="mt-4 text-[28px] md:text-[40px] font-black tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.95]">One experience. <span class="text-zinc-400">Different targets.</span></h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400">Not “write once, run anywhere.” One polished development experience, with platform-appropriate output.</p>
